config BR2_PACKAGE_CONTAINERD_BIN
	bool "containerd (static binary)"
	depends on BR2_x86_64
	help
	  containerd container runtime, installed from the official static
	  linux/amd64 release (bundles containerd, containerd-shim-runc-v2, ctr).
	  Pinned independently of Buildroot's in-tree containerd so the NodeOS k8s
	  profile can track the desired version (2.3.x). Disable BR2_PACKAGE_CONTAINERD
	  (the in-tree 2.0.x package) when using this.

	  https://containerd.io
